{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using resnet50 image encoder and weighted fusion, compared to the concat fusion baseline with imagenet_vit_l (config_007). Validation accuracy of 0.6776 is lower than the concat fusion baseline (0.7150), suggesting potential differences in fusion strategy or image encoder impact. Uncertainty remains about whether the choice of image encoder (resnet50 vs. imagenet_vit_l) or fusion method (weighted vs. concat) is more critical, as the experiment isolates these factors but does not directly compare their individual effects."
}

